  (text "POWER - three INDEPENDENT bricks, one per module. Deliberately not commoned:\\nboard-level redundancy is meaningless if one supply can take all three down.\\nGrounds meet at a single star point (see GND_STAR).\\nEach module arbitrates its own inputs internally via LTC4417 (U1101)." (at 177.8 40.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid b900e5a9-2e09-4dfd-b27e-b667062914ad)
